\**{c=red:Note:}** This Mission is not required. It can be skipped by trading enough Crystals (3+) to a {p:Conquest Overseer} or by repeating other Missions.
=2 Walkthrough
If you wish to complete this Mission, trade enough Crystals to a {p:Conquest Overseer} to raise your Rank bar and unlock it.
* Talk to any {n:Gate Guard} and accept the Mission.
** There are two in {z:Southern San d'Oria}, {n:Ambrotien} at (K-6) and {n:Endracion} at (F-9). There is also a gate guard in {z:Northern San d'Oria}, {n:Grilau} at (D-8).
** A map of {z:Davoi} can be purchased for 3000 Gil from {n:Elesca} at (I-8) of {z:North San d'Oria} or {n:Violitte} at (G-10) of {z:Southern San d'Oria}, but it is not required.
* Make your way to {z:Davoi}. To reach {z:Davoi}, zone into {z:Jugner Forest} from {z:La Theine Plateau} at (M-8). Then follow the right wall of {z:Jugner Forest} to the zone into {z:Davoi} at (G-12).
* Talk to the NPC {n:Zantaviat} just inside the zone.
* Walk south until you reach a pond at (J-8). On the South bank of the pond you will find a **!** targetable location. Click on it to receive the {@k} {k:Lost document}.
* Return to {n:Zantaviat} to recieve the {@k} {k:Temple Knights' Davoi report}.
* Return to a {n:Gate Guard}.
* Examine the **Door: Papal Chambers**, which is on the top floor of the **Cathedral** in {z:Northern San d'Oria}.
* After the cutscene, the Mission will be completed.

